{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-sng-2-1","title":"Song of Solomon 2:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The mutual love of Christ and his church. 8 The hope, 10 and calling of the church. 14 Christ's care of the church. 16 The profession of the church, her faith, and hope.</p>\n<p>the rose. Ps 85:11; Isa 35:1,2 lily. 16; 6:3; Isa 57:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-2-2","title":"Song of Solomon 2:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Isa 55:13; Mt 6:28,29; 10:16; Php 2:15,16; 1Pe 2:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-2-3","title":"Song of Solomon 2:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>the apple tree. 8:5; Isa 4:2; Eze 17:23,24; Joh 15:1-8 my beloved. 5:9,10,16; Ps 45:2; 89:6; Joh 1:14-18; 3:29-31; Heb 1:1-6; 3:1-6 Heb 7:23-26; 12:2 I sat, etc. Heb. I delighted and sat down, etc. Jud 9:15,19,20; Ps 57:1; 91:1; Isa 4:6; 25:4; 32:2; 1Jo 1:3,4 his fruit. 5; Ge 3:22-24; Eze 47:12; Re 22:1,2 taste. Heb. palate.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-2-4","title":"Song of Solomon 2:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>brought. 1:4; 5:1; Ps 63:2-5; 84:10; Joh 14:21-23; Re 3:20 banqueting house. Heb. house of wine. 1:1,4; Es 7:7 his banner. 6:4; Job 1:10; Ps 60:4; Isa 11:10; Joh 15:9-15; Ro 5:8-10; 8:28-39</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-2-5","title":"Song of Solomon 2:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Stay. Ps 4:6,7; 42:1,2; 63:1-3,8; Isa 26:8,9; Lu 24:32; Php 1:23 flagons. 2Sa 6:19; Ho 3:1 comfort me. Heb. straw me. for. 5:8; 2Sa 13:1,2; Ps 119:130,131</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-2-6","title":"Song of Solomon 2:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>8:3-5; Isa 54:5-10; 62:4,5; Jer 32:41; Zep 3:17; Joh 3:29 Eph 5:25-29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-2-7","title":"Song of Solomon 2:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>charge you. Heb. adjure you. Mt 26:63 O ye. 1:5; 5:8,16 by the roes. 3:5; Pr 5:19 ye stir. 8:4; Eph 5:22-33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-2-8","title":"Song of Solomon 2:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>voice. 5:2; Joh 3:29; 10:4,5,27; Re 3:20 leaping. 2Sa 6:16; Isa 35:6; Jer 48:27; Lu 6:23; Ac 3:8; 14:10 the mountains. Isa 40:3,4; 44:23; 49:11-13; 55:12,13; Lu 3:4-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-2-9","title":"Song of Solomon 2:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>like. 17; 8:14 he standeth. 1Co 13:12; 2Co 3:13-18; Eph 2:14,15; Col 2:17; Heb 9:8,9 Heb 10:1,19,20 shewing. Heb. flourishing. Lu 24:35; Joh 5:39,46; 12:41; 1Pe 1:10-12; Re 19:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-2-10","title":"Song of Solomon 2:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>spake. 8; 2Sa 23:3; Ps 85:8; Jer 31:3 Rise. 13; 4:7,8; 5:2; Ge 12:1-3; Ps 45:10,11; Mt 4:19-22; 9:9; 2Co 6:17,18 2Co 11:2; Re 19:7-9; 22:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-2-11","title":"Song of Solomon 2:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Ec 3:4,11; Isa 12:1,2; 40:2; 54:6-8; 60:1,2; Mt 5:4; Eph 5:8 Re 11:14,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-2-12","title":"Song of Solomon 2:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>flowers. 6:2,11; Isa 35:1,2; Ho 14:5-7 time. Ps 40:1-3; 89:15; 148:7-13; Isa 42:10-12; 55:12; Eph 5:18-20 Col 3:16 of the turtle. Ro 15:9-13; Eph 1:13,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-2-13","title":"Song of Solomon 2:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>fig-tree. 6:11; 7:8,11-13; Isa 18:5; 55:10,11; 61:11; Ho 14:6; Hag 2:19 Lu 13:6,7 Arise. 10; Lu 19:42; 2Co 5:20; 6:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-2-14","title":"Song of Solomon 2:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>my dove. 5:2; 6:9; Ps 68:13; 74:19; Isa 60:8; Eze 7:16; Mt 3:16; 10:16 that art. Ex 3:6; 4:11-13; Ezr 9:5,6; Job 9:16; Isa 6:5; Da 9:7; Lu 8:47,48 clefts. Ex 33:22,23; Isa 2:21; Jer 49:16; Ob 1:3 let me hear. 8:13; Ps 50:14,15; Pr 15:8; Heb 4:16; 10:22 for sweet. Ps 22:3; 50:23; Isa 51:3; Re 4:8-10; 5:8; 7:9,10 thy countenance. 1:5,8; 6:10; Ps 45:11; 110:3; Eph 5:27; Col 1:22; 1Pe 3:4; Jude 1:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-2-15","title":"Song of Solomon 2:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>the foxes. Ps 80:13; Eze 13:4-16; Lu 13:32; 2Pe 2:1-3; Re 2:2 tender. 13; 7:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-2-16","title":"Song of Solomon 2:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>beloved. 6:3; 7:10,13; Ps 48:14; 63:1; Jer 31:33; 1Co 3:21-23; Ga 2:20 Re 21:2,3 he. 1; 1:7; 6:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-2-17","title":"Song of Solomon 2:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>the day. 4:6; Lu 1:78; Ro 13:12; 2Pe 1:19 the shadows. Heb 8:5; 10:1 beloved. 9; 8:14 Bether. or, division.</p>"}]}